cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "TVGD — Teoria do Vácuo Gravitacional Dispersivo: Public Validation Repository"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Bauman"
    given-names: "Marcelo"

abstract: >
  This repository contains the public numerical validation package for the
  Teoria do Vácuo Gravitacional Dispersivo (TVGD), an effective and falsifiable
  gravitational framework under development. The repository includes scripts for
  galaxy dynamics, black-hole structural saturation, cosmological background
  checks, Hubble-transition modeling, RSD/fσ8 consistency, PPN/covariant-risk
  diagnostics, external validation tests, and falsifiability checklists.

keywords:
  - gravity
  - modified gravity
  - effective field theory
  - galaxy dynamics
  - radial acceleration relation
  - black holes
  - Hubble tension
  - cosmology
  - falsifiability
  - TVGD

repository-code: "https://github.com/marcelobauman82-netizen/tvgd-public-tests"
